{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simple and casual 2D platformer game with cute, brightly colored pixel graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help the bubble guy travel through various worlds, including steep mountains, clear lakes, scorching deserts, dilapidated factories, flourishing farms, and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap over obstacles, stomp on enemies, avoid the hostile creatures and water sources that are dangerous to the bubble guy, and reach the final destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 14 levels in total. As you progress, you can unlock new skills and new skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overall, it\u2019s not difficult to complete the game, but some levels require a bit of skill. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614140?t=1743049991","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614140/8cd36413e4e4f87ecb83d0434bf692f002656e8a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743049991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614140/82374fdf4fc521318b96423e1b5679088ee72e9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743049991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614140/82374fdf4fc521318b96423e1b5679088ee72e9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743049991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simple and casual 2D platformer game with cute, brightly colored pixel graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help the bubble guy travel through various worlds, including steep mountains, clear lakes, scorching deserts, dilapidated factories, flourishing farms, and more.\u00a0</p